N-arachidonyl-ethanolamide

The purpose of this test is to have a molecule with multiple type 1 dihedrals.

Molecule itp and gro from
Bartocci, A.; Souza, P. C. T.; Cecchini, M. 
A millisecond coarsegrained simulation approach to decipher allosteric 
cannabinoid binding at the glycine receptor α1.
bioRxiv 2023, 2023–04. 10.1101/2023.04.19.537578
https://mad.ibcp.fr/molecule/AEA
